        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Nzian pui ram ning tan mak ge,",
            "Rianra ram me hei tei;",
            "Ring bam san hei rianra khang nai,",
            "Ai lei ni kap pui ram.",
            "",
            "Kandi rian ra mei man pu khou,",
            "Kap pui ting...mik ni man ni;",
            "Poubaomei lun hou pu khou rui,",
            "Ning dat lak khe kandi hei.",
            "",
            "2. Kalvary nthuk pui zei rui,",
            "Tingkao kaikham laan lou;",
            "Gutla tho he abumaeng le,",
            "Nang ram tang khang na the.",
            "",
            "3. Kapmei rian ra mei man ni the,",
            "Jordan dui pang thang tei;",
            "He! Abumang le patla tho,",
            "Kandi kab pui ram hei.",
            "",
            "4. Tabui nung guang tang nina cho?",
            "Tingkao gaipui ram tei;",
            "Kandi ram hei patlou pukhou",
            "Ning lak khe kap pui ram."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
